review:
ok... take everything good from the first game (so, the whole game), then:
[list]
[*]make it [b]better[/b] overall;
[*]add a bunch [b]more abilities[/b];
[*]add actual [b]melee and ranged weapons[/b];
[*]add [b]equippable skills[/b] (think Hollow Knight's charms);
[*]add [b]more enemies[/b];
[*]add actual [b]boss fights[/b];
[*]add [b]NPCs and sidequests[/b]
[*]add [b]more suffering[/b] into the plot;
[/list]

... and you've got Ori and the Will of the Wisps.
